"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434720/extras/e3873e7baa56bf8b3deb7b513a79d423.avif?t=1698873870\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgradable arsenal</h2>Throughout the levels you will not only find new dice to pick up, but there are also upgrades to be assigned. The upgrades are applied per dice, so better pick carefully. Upgrades expand on the dice\u2019s usability, sometimes even letting you play in a way that was not possible without the upgrade.",
    "short_description": "Maces and Dices is a turned based rogue-like where dice decide what actions you can take, but it is up to you to make the most out of every roll. When both your healthbar and available actions consist of dice, you better hope that you have brought the right ones.",
